  "description": "** Enquiries by email only** M&C Property are pleased to present to the market this recently renovated 2 bedroom city centre apartment located in Windmill House, Limerick. The ideal location provides easy access to the motorway, minutes walk from city centre and all bus routes and easy access to Shannon. Located approximately 7 km from the University of Limerick and the National Technology Park with companies such as Cook Medical, and Johnson & Johnson, and approximately 6km to Raheen Business Park with companies such as Eli Lily and Regeneron.\n\nAccommodation: Open plan living / dining / kitchen space with an abundance of natural light . 2 bedrooms (1 double & 1 single), Spacious main bathroom,  Refuse collection included. References essential before viewing.\n\n***WE WELCOME APPLICANTS FROM HOMEHAK FOR ALL OF OUR PROPERTIES***",
